an begin="00:25.232" end="00:25.422">What </span><span begin="00:25.422" end="00:25.622">I've </span><span begin="00:25.622" end="00:26.012">done </span><span begin="00:26.012" end="00:26.312">to </span><span begin="00:26.312" end="00:28.262">me</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:28.262" end="00:31.312"><span begin="00:28.262" end="00:28.432">I </span><span begin="00:28.432" end="00:28.732">am </span><span begin="00:28.732" end="00:29.632">misused  </span><span begin="00:29.632" end="00:29.842">I </span><span begin="00:29.842" end="00:30.122">don't </span><span begin="00:30.122" end="00:30.402">wanna </span><span begin="00:30.402" end="00:31.312">do</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:31.312" end="00:34.342"><span begin="00:31.312" end="00:31.502">Be </span><span begin="00:31.502" end="00:31.772">not </span><span begin="00:31.772" end="00:32.122">your </span><span begin="00:32.122" end="00:34.342">slave</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:34.342" end="00:37.851"><span begin="00:34.342" end="00:36.141">Misguided  </span><span begin="00:36.141" end="00:36.371">I </span><span begin="00:36.371" end="00:36.591">mind </span><span begin="00:36.591" end="00:37.851">it</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:37.851" end="00:47.001"><span begin="00:37.851" end="00:38.061">I'm </span><span begin="00:38.061" end="00:38.211">missin' </span><span begin="00:38.211" end="00:38.581">the </span><span begin="00:38.581" end="00:47.001">train</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:47.001" end="00:49.661"><span begin="00:47.001" end="00:47.191">And </span><span begin="00:47.191" end="00:47.371">I </span><span begin="00:47.371" end="00:47.541">don't </span><span begin="00:47.541" end="00:47.881">know </span><span begin="00:47.881" end="00:48.191">where </span><span begin="00:48.191" end="00:48.581">I've </span><span begin="00:48.581" end="00:49.661">been</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:49.661" end="00:52.781"><span begin="00:49.661" end="00:49.861">And </span><span begin="00:49.