n</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:10.311" end="01:13.481"><span begin="01:10.311" end="01:10.521">So </span><span begin="01:10.521" end="01:10.711">I'll </span><span begin="01:10.711" end="01:11.131">waste </span><span begin="01:11.131" end="01:11.971">my </span><span begin="01:11.971" end="01:12.841">time </span><span begin="01:12.841" end="01:13.481">and</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:13.481" end="01:16.151"><span begin="01:13.481" end="01:13.681">I'll </span><span begin="01:13.681" end="01:14.241">burn </span><span begin="01:14.241" end="01:14.851">my </span><span begin="01:14.851" end="01:16.151">mind</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:16.151" end="01:26.501"><span begin="01:16.151" end="01:16.341">On </span><span begin="01:16.341" end="01:16.691">miss </span><span begin="01:16.691" end="01:18.731">nothing  </span><span begin="01:18.731" end="01:18.971">miss </span><span begin="01:18.971" end="01:26.501">everything</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:26.501" end="01:29.421"><span begin="01:26.501" end="01:26.691">I'm </span><span begin="01:26.691" end="01:26.871">miss </span><span begin="01:26.871" end="01:27.861">fortune  </span><span begin="01:27.861" end="01:28.111">miss </span><span begin="01:28.111" end="01:28.501">so </span><span begin="01:28.501" end="01:29.421">soon</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:29.421" end="01:32.561"><span begin="01:29.421" end="01:29.731">I'm </span><span begin="01:29.731" end="01:29.931">like </span><span begin="01:29.931" end="01:30.171">a </span><span begin="01:30.171" end="01:30.461">bottle </span><span begin="01:30.461" end="01:30.651">of </span><span begin="01:30.651" end="01:32.561">pain</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:32.561" end="01:35.491"><span begin="01:32.561" end="01:32.761">Miss </span><span begin="01:32.761" end="01:33.911">matter  </span><span begin="01:33.911" end="01:34.101">you </span><span begin="01:34.101" end="01:34.301">had </span><span begin="01:34.301" end="01:35.491">her</span