 begin="01:54.041" end="01:54.231">I </span><span begin="01:54.231" end="01:54.561">don't </span><span begin="01:54.561" end="01:54.731">know </span><span begin="01:54.731" end="01:55.101">what </span><span begin="01:55.101" end="01:55.421">I'm </span><span begin="01:55.421" end="01:56.921">into</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:56.921" end="02:03.551"><span begin="01:56.921" end="01:57.101">And </span><span begin="01:57.101" end="01:57.261">I </span><span begin="01:57.261" end="01:57.641">don't </span><span begin="01:57.641" end="01:58.001">know </span><span begin="01:58.001" end="01:58.201">what </span><span begin="01:58.201" end="01:58.561">I've </span><span begin="01:58.561" end="01:58.871">done </span><span begin="01:58.871" end="01:59.191">to </span><span begin="01:59.191" end="02:03.551">me</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:03.551" end="02:06.571"><span begin="02:03.551" end="02:03.731">And </span><span begin="02:03.731" end="02:03.891">as </span><span begin="02:03.891" end="02:04.231">I </span><span begin="02:04.231" end="02:04.561">watch </span><span begin="02:04.561" end="02:04.831">you </span><span begin="02:04.831" end="02:06.571">disappear</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:06.571" end="02:07.921"><span begin="02:06.571" end="02:06.741">Into </span><span begin="02:06.741" end="02:06.901">the </span><span begin="02:06.901" end="02:09.401">ground</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:09.401" end="02:11.341"><span begin="02:09.401" end="02:09.601">My </span><span begin="02:09.601" end="02:09.761">one </span><span begin="02:09.761" end="02:10.271">mistake </span><span begin="02:10.271" end="02:10.911">was </span><span begin="02:10.911" end="02:11.341">that</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:11.341" end="02:14.501"><span begin="02:11.341" end="02:11.521">I </span><span begin="02:11.521" end="02:12.051">couldn't </span><span begin="02:12.051" end="02:12.491">let </span><span begin="02:12.491" end="02:12.781">you </span><span begin="02:12.781" en